OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric garden adapts as hosepipe
OL,4,Aban takes effect
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior Marketing and Communications
OL,7,FOffice, Clare Gascoigne, said: "All of
OL,8,Fthese elements feed into decreasing our
OL,9,Fwater usage, which is a really
OL,10,Fimportant part of dealing with climate
OL,11,Fchange."
